# Great Gilded Boat: "Whenever you attack, recruit" (CR 508.1, 701.70a). On turn 3 Bot1 attacks with a Zephyr Sprite alone (its power 1 can't crew 2: the refusal), the Boat
# neither crewed nor attacking, and the Boat's trigger still goes on the stack: Bot1 draws an Island, discards the Ornithopter it drew for the turn (a nonland card)
# and gets a 1/1 white Human Soldier token. Bot2's turn-2 draw and the like trigger nothing.

